# Game end: Tobi (bankruptcy) when any player drops strictly below 0 (engine.md §5 step 1, rules.md §4.29).
# East 1, sticks=1, scores: 1000 35000 32000 31000.
# Seat 0 deals 7s into Seat 2 (pinfu + tanyao = 2 han 30 fu = 2000 + 1000 stick = +3000).
# Seat 0 drops to -1000 (< 0) -> game ends immediately!
# Final scores: -1000 35000 35000 31000.
# Tie-break for 1st between Seat 1 (35000) and Seat 2 (35000): starting seat order -> Seat 1 is 1st, Seat 2 is 2nd.

[meta]
